.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.claude/settings.local.json
# Python bytecode: an import beside a committed `.py` (e.g. scripts/mutation-sweep.py)
# must not sweep a `.pyc` in — the scanner reads a committed `.pyc` as a supply-chain smell.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The two bytecode-named fixtures are the sole ground for two selftest rows;
# a contributor's global excludes must not hide them.
!scripts/lint-fixtures/security/injected-skill/__pycache__/
!scripts/lint-fixtures/security/injected-skill/__pycache__/*.pyc
!scripts/lint-fixtures/security/injected-skill/lib/*.pyo
!scripts/lint-fixtures/security/injected-skill/lib/*.pyc
